#: keyslot/configuration.py:396
msgid "This profile's favicon timeout is outside the supported 1–300 second range. Its original setting was preserved."
msgstr "Limit czasu favicon w tym profilu wykracza poza obsługiwany zakres 1–300 sekund. Zachowano oryginalne ustawienie."

#: keyslot/configuration.py:402
